      "text": "AI is too hyped right now.\n\nThe technology is will fundamentally change humanity for the better.\n\nBut the fever-pitch-excitement and every-VC-pivoting-to-AI will invariably lead to disappointment and a deflated hype cycle.\n\nLet’s focus on the long game and real impact.",
