      "text": "A missing piece to open-source foundation models is RLHF (reinforcement learning w/human feedback) like InstructGPT\n\nIt’s one of OpenAI/GPT-3’s “secret ingredients”\n\n@scale_AI is funding an open RLHF implementation.\n\nIf you’re an ML researcher &amp; interested in a fellowship, DM me.",
