      "text": "Not to call out all the web3 folks, but there’s a stark contrast between web3 and AI.\n\nweb3 at peak: “all the smartest people are working on it, cool stuff will happen”\n\nAI at peak (today): “you can literally perform magic, oh and also all the smartest people are working on it”",
