      },
      "text": "The way that Bezos and the AMZN team derived AWS was by asking:\n\n“If compute costs will trend to 0 in perpetuity, what business would you build?”\n\nThe purity is staggering. Today’s AI parallel is:\n\n“If LLMs will continue to gain more capability, what business would you build?”",
